      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲟⲩϣⲏⲣⲉ ⲡⲉ ϫⲉⲧⲱϥ ⲧⲉ ⲧⲉ**ⲕⲗⲏⲣⲟⲛⲟⲙⲓⲁ** ·",
      "english": "The Son saith, 'To Him belongeth the inheritance.'",
